@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #52637A
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF5FC
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF5FC
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EFF5FC
skinparam roundcorner 10
title 四类角色与功能范围 · 用例图（行为性图）
left to right direction
actor 参与者 as P
actor 组织者 as O
actor 检票人员 as C
actor 平台管理员 as A
actor "系统时钟 / Worker" as W
rectangle 活动票务与报名系统 {
usecase "注册 / 登录" as U1
usecase "组合查询活动" as U2
usecase "报名 / 查询凭证\n取消本人报名" as U3
usecase "主动候补 / 退出候补" as U4
usecase "查看站内通知" as U5
usecase "活动与场次票种配置\n提交审核 / 修改 / 取消" as U6
usecase "授权场次检票人员" as U7
usecase "统计 / 名单筛选与导出" as U8
usecase "扫描 / 输入凭证验票" as U9
usecase "首次及变更审核\n违规活动取消" as U10
usecase "账号角色管理" as U11
usecase "授权范围日志查询" as U12
usecase "自动递补 / 截止失效\n场次结束缺席处理" as U13
usecase "通知投递重试" as U14
}
P --> U1
P --> U2
P --> U3
P --> U4
P --> U5
O --> U6
O --> U7
O --> U8
O --> U12
C --> U9
A --> U10
A --> U11
A --> U8 : 平台汇总
A --> U12
W --> U13
W --> U14
note bottom of U8
组织者：仅自己的活动名单、统计。
管理员：授权范围平台汇总；不因此自动获得名单导出权限。
角色兼任规则待确认，图中不设置角色继承。
end note
@enduml
